WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.808
Tom liked to go to the farm.

2
00:00:15.809 --> 00:00:23.566
Every morning the farmer's wife milked the cows.

3
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:27.172
She always gave Tom some milk.

4
00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:42.680
Mmm!

5
00:00:42.681 --> 00:00:53.741
One morning Tom wanted more milk.

6
00:00:53.742 --> 00:00:57.702
So he ran to the lamb pen.

7
00:00:57.703 --> 00:01:02.734
Tom hid under some wool.

8
00:01:02.735 --> 00:01:07.111
Soon the farmer's wife came.

9
00:01:07.112 --> 00:01:20.888
She gave the lambs their bottles.

10
00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:24.483
The farmer's wife spotted Tom.

11
00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:27.916
"Silly kitten!" she said.

12
00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:40.062
"You had some milk already!"

13
00:01:40.063 --> 00:01:43.400
Next the farmer's wife went to the goats.

14
00:01:43.401 --> 00:01:49.235
She brought some milk bottles.

15
00:01:49.236 --> 00:01:53.987
Tom ran after her.

16
00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:57.492
Tom tried to get a bottle first.

17
00:01:57.493 --> 00:02:00.099
"Neigh!" said the goats.

18
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:03.915
"Go away, Tom!"

19
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:07.672
The farmer's wife saw Tom.

20
00:02:07.673 --> 00:02:16.573
"Naughty kitten!" she said. "Shoo!"

21
00:02:16.574 --> 00:02:27.272
The farmer's wife gave Kep some milk.

22
00:02:27.273 --> 00:02:38.651
Tom ran toward Kep.

23
00:02:38.652 --> 00:02:40.620
But Kep growled.

24
00:02:40.621 --> 00:02:46.905
"Stay away, Tom!" he said.

